{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "巴利本見 MN III, PTS 1977: 109,2-13。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "日譯本見《南伝大蔵経．中部經典（四）．空小經》，大正新脩大藏經刊行會 1971(1936): 126-127。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "巴利本見 MN III, PTS 1977: 109,2-13。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "日譯本見《南伝大蔵経．中部經典（四）．空小經》，大正新脩大藏經刊行會 1971(1936): 126-127。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "巴利本見 MN III, PTS 1977: 109,2-13。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "日譯本見《南伝大蔵経．中部經典（四）．空小經》，大正新脩大藏經刊行會 1971(1936): 126-127。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "巴利本見 MN III, PTS 1977: 109,2-13。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "日譯本見《南伝大蔵経．中部經典（四）．空小經》，大正新脩大藏經刊行會 1971(1936): 126-127。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "《南傳大藏經》（高楠博士功績記念會纂譯，東京：大藏出版株式會社，昭和46年再刊發行，第11卷下第129頁）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0113004", "type": "mod", "text": "出家云云由次受具足之文推之，此不能臆測為出家式（得度式）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002001", "type": "orig", "text": "不親近（anupāyo）以 an+upāyo 看為無方便。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0002002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0002002", "type": "orig", "text": "不沒入（anapāyo）以由 an+apa+i 而來之語而譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0005003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0005003", "type": "orig", "text": "於聖想（ariyāya saññāya）之有「於聖慧」（ariyāya paññāya），當然是後者謂正確。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0021004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0021004", "type": "orig", "text": "彼作性（tammayatā），於註釋書，為渴愛 taṇhā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0025005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0025005", "type": "orig", "text": "赤手（lahitāpaṇi）從玄奘譯。原字意為手染血的人。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0025006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0025006", "type": "orig", "text": "有主之女（saparidaṇdā）謂 a waman protected by a stick 之原意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0027007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0027007", "type": "orig", "text": "知原本雖為 na jānāmi，此乃誤傳。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0034008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0034008", "type": "orig", "text": "語行於原本 kāyasamācāraṁ 即為身行，想是由此下略文之關係而錯誤，因此今暫如所記以訂正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0050009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0050009", "type": "orig", "text": "見云云下皆用「現在之歷史」。今亦仍如是譯出，其他同樣時亦類此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0063010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0063010", "type": "orig", "text": "善善云云（abhiññātehi abhiññātehi）即暫以疊語之力說譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081011", "type": "orig", "text": "見證之可能原本為 sakkhibhavyatam 今以 sacchibhabbstaṁ 譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105001", "type": "orig", "text": "兜率身（Tusita-kāya）兜率天眾之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107002", "type": "orig", "text": "妙欲（kāmaguṇa）於北傳皆譯為欲功德。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112003", "type": "orig", "text": "以下對諸註之文，原本雖不附（），恐有逸脫，今加附之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113004", "type": "orig", "text": "出家云云由次受具足之文推之，此不能憶側為出家式（得度式）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114005", "type": "orig", "text": "洗肢體原本有 gattaparikamme byāpajjita 想是錯誤，今讀為 gattaparikamme vyāpāritā＝肢體之準備，從事於（洗、按摩等）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0116006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0116006", "type": "orig", "text": "阿義耶薩那（Aggivessana）阿夷羅和提沙彌之稱呼。中含作阿奇沙那。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0124007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0124007", "type": "orig", "text": "「對於心」之次於原本有「對於法」之續述，此關於所謂四念之觀法，中途之略記，例如唯前後詳述之形式者，暫取其意，故改譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0128008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0128008", "type": "orig", "text": "只管如往還力說之語，以取其意而譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0143009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0143009", "type": "orig", "text": "法王原本有 dhammassāmi 為呼格，已有 bhante（尊！）今暫讀為 dhammassāmi。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0144010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0144010", "type": "orig", "text": "此偈亦出於律之憍賞彌篇中，請參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0144011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0144011", "type": "orig", "text": "他云云原本 nāññaṁ bhiyyo aṁññarum（or amaññatha）為兩重否定，因難取其意義，讀取最後之 maññaruṁ or maññatha。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0146012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0146012", "type": "orig", "text": "那伽云云原本有 mātaṅg, araññe va nāgo 以 mātaṅgo araññe va nāgo 譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0146013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0146013", "type": "orig", "text": "自愛形（attakāmarūpā）是「愛自己」之意，近乎「悠悠自適」之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0150014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0150014", "type": "orig", "text": "為其云云原本雖為 uahatonidānaṁ 異本為 tato nidānaṁ 故，今從此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0153015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0153015", "type": "orig", "text": "捨俱行定云云此上雖略記之符號，想是作此打算（故此勿記樂俱行定故）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0155016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0155016", "type": "orig", "text": "飲酒者原本例如「飲者於須羅，迷羅耶酒之放逸處」（surāmeraya majjapāmadaṭṭhāyi）若照如此記述，其文過長故，今略之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0157017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0157017", "type": "orig", "text": "彼其比丘（Sa kho so bhikkhu〔bālo〕）下之賢者時，「彼其，諸比丘！賢者……」即為（Sa kho so, bhikkhave, pandito…）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0159018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0159018", "type": "orig", "text": "四隅云云次經，於此一句，作為偈形。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0161019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0161019", "type": "orig", "text": "軛 yugani 中阿含為「小輕木板」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0165020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0165020", "type": "orig", "text": "敵王 paṭirājāno 於長含十八等作為「小王」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0166021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0166021", "type": "orig", "text": "想是公唱於原本雖有 akkhāhataṁ maññe 同 D. II. P. 174 之文中，有 akkhātāṁ maññe（proclaimed methink）而從之。暫如此譯之，因右之長部譯者 Rhys Davids 夫妻以譯為 \"Remained fixed on on the open-terrace\"。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169022", "type": "orig", "text": "以應諮問（anusāsissāmi）「忠言」之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169023", "type": "orig", "text": "有等熟力（samavepākiniyā samannāgato）同後善消化之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0169024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0169024", "type": "orig", "text": "善消化力（gahaṇiyā samannāgato）gahani = the \"seizer\" a supposed organ of the body dealing with digestion and gestation. 集異門足論、十三、五勝支之三…「少疾無病而成等熟腹…」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0176025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0176025", "type": "orig", "text": "五種連 pañcavidhābandhana 譯為「五重組」亦可。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0180026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0180026", "type": "orig", "text": "彼原本雖缺 so，今依別本補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0182001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0182001", "type": "orig", "text": "一夜賢者（Bhaddekaratta）於漢譯（阿難說經、溫泉林天經、釋中禪室尊經）音譯為跋地羅帝。完全努力於現在之生活，於現在而言者，如修行哲人等應為之心。下第百三十四之相當經之尊上經（大正藏、七七）記為賢善偈。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0194002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0194002", "type": "orig", "text": "親 eva 想是（實）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0194003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0194003", "type": "orig", "text": "有於別本 ahosi 為（有）似關於已經過去之機會而作。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0194004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0194004", "type": "orig", "text": "無躊躇（agarukaritvā）「於世尊、或於我等，無特別表示敬意」，或「不想為打攪」等意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0211005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0211005", "type": "orig", "text": "敢想是 yāvatako ahosi。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0212006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0212006", "type": "orig", "text": "一向（ekaṅsena）全面的、全稱之意，總之，部分的之反對。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221007", "type": "orig", "text": "行upavicāra 譯為與伺察同字。玄奘譯為近行參照（集異足論十五等）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0221008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0221008", "type": "orig", "text": "見（samanupassato）普徧，且善觀察之意，玄奘屢次譯為「等隨觀見」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0222009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0222009", "type": "orig", "text": "而 tveva，蓋，此字是（tu eva）now, but, indeed, however 等之意，「諸色等不唯我等日常之認識。」應有此程度之意？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0225010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0225010", "type": "orig", "text": "不彼作性（atammayatā），tammayatā 是渴愛（taṇhā）。故不彼作性者，即無渴愛。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0226011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0226011", "type": "orig", "text": "智心原本於作 añña-cittaṁ 照對上來之同文，讀為 aññā-cittaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231012", "type": "orig", "text": "有也於前之一三三、大迦旃延一夜賢者經之相應文中，作為現在（hoti）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0231013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0231013", "type": "orig", "text": "不介意（agarukaritvā）參照前註[04]。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0235014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0235014", "type": "orig", "text": "取而不住於原本有 cittaṁ pariyādāya tiṭṭhanti 照上之同文，要加上 na 讀之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0239015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0239015", "type": "orig", "text": "非義苦（anatthadukkhaṁ），此意思雖無不通，若其他相應此文，不能不是「不持利益」（anatthasaṁ hitaṁ）之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243016", "type": "orig", "text": "聲（sara）或調。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0243017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0243017", "type": "orig", "text": "同一物以 tad eva 譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0247018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0247018", "type": "orig", "text": "仰為師（uddissa）= ger, of uddisati = to declare, to point out."}
{"id": null, "n": "0247019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0247019", "type": "orig", "text": "信仰今認為 saddhā（信仰）之具格譯之，但亦可看為動詞 saddahati 之 gerund（信仰）佛音見如後者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249020", "type": "orig", "text": "其處云云之上下，想不要括抓，但原本有之即暫照原來。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249021", "type": "orig", "text": "想歡喜以 maññussavā 看為 mañña = thinking；ussava = merrymaking 讀之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249022", "type": "orig", "text": "捨（cāga）亦譯為施。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249023", "type": "orig", "text": "水界原本逸脫。今以順理補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0249024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0249024", "type": "orig", "text": "眼識於原本 cakkumā（cakkhumant 有具眼者之 nom.）如其耳、鼻識，為 cakkhuna 之誤讀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0250025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0250025", "type": "orig", "text": "所執受（upādiṇṇa）玄奘譯，法蘊足論，十之同文下，有「有執有受。」蓋 upādiṇna 乃 grasped at; laid hold of; the issue of grasping 等之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0255026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0255026", "type": "orig", "text": "妄想（maññitaṁ）於中阿含六界經，譯為自舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256027", "type": "orig", "text": "大過云云（accayaṁ accayato paṭiggaṇhātu āyatiṁ saṁvarāya）於懺悔之時，一定之型狀，約言：「將來當防護，今請原諒。」之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256028", "type": "orig", "text": "如何，（原因）yaṁ 暫以關係代名詞譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0257029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0257029", "type": "orig", "text": "我云云若為複數者，同英語等，以王之「朕」為 we。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0267030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0267030", "type": "orig", "text": "對人施（pāṭipuggalika dakkhiṇā）對個人施之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268031", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268031", "type": "orig", "text": "僧類施（saṅghagatā dakkhiṇā）對僧伽多人相之布施。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268032", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268032", "type": "orig", "text": "兩僧伽（ubhatosaṅgha）言比丘比丘尼之兩僧伽。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0268033", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0268033", "type": "orig", "text": "僧類施云云僧類施乃僧伽施（眾人），對人施，乃言對個人施，由此區別，應知有此教說。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0269034", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0269034", "type": "orig", "text": "此偈出集異門足論八，請參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0273001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0273001", "type": "orig", "text": "減退之終云云原本 paṭikkamosānaṁ paññāyati no abhikkamo「無施設減退之終局、進展之終局否？」之意思。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0273002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0273002", "type": "orig", "text": "中部經典三，第九十七，陀然經參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0273003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0273003", "type": "orig", "text": "不執受 upādiyissāmi = I will not take hold of or cling to 之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274004", "type": "orig", "text": "我云云於此之前有「是故，長者！汝應如是學」之文，茲乃逸脫。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0274005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0274005", "type": "orig", "text": "耳觸於原本 sotasamphassaṁ viññāṇaṁ 即「耳觸識」，於此想關於六觸身的說明，如前之眼識，蓋不用其識字，因此以下悉皆略去。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0276006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0276006", "type": "orig", "text": "不舉原本之 Na paṭibhāti = does not appear or occur to(or upon), does not shine upon 等意，今如此譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0287007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0287007", "type": "orig", "text": "宜云云「應去」之婉曲語，究竟是「再會」之意。北傳雜阿含之相應處，有「汝今宜去」。又同北傳的各處言「汝今當（或、知）知時」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0290008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0290008", "type": "orig", "text": "聖 ayya 乃 a contracted form of ariya。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0291009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0291009", "type": "orig", "text": "如是（evaṁ hoti）即「如是解」之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295010", "type": "orig", "text": "有堅 sāravant = having essence, heart or hardest part 國語譯為堅實等，漢譯有譯例，實其亦可解為果實之意，特避此，唯為「有堅」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0297011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0297011", "type": "orig", "text": "同義語（adhivacana）一般漢譯謂「增語」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0297012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0297012", "type": "orig", "text": "如何（因為），當 ya 乃心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0298013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0298013", "type": "orig", "text": "同云云原本有 Tena hi tvaṁ, Nandaka, sve…ten'cva…，返復以見 tena 即如是譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301014", "type": "orig", "text": "生茂之林原之 Andhavana 於漢譯為安陀林。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0301015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0301015", "type": "orig", "text": "晝住（divāvihāra）北傳譯為日中正受。日中過熱之間，入陰涼之林中坐禪，乃比丘等之所習。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0306016", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0306016", "type": "orig", "text": "三之和合云云以 tinnam samgati phasso 直譯，即：「三之和合乃觸」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0307017", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0307017", "type": "orig", "text": "不可以 taṁ na uppajjati 直譯，雖可為「彼不起」，其意思：「無遭受」，暫以不可譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0307018", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0307018", "type": "orig", "text": "有paññāyati＝施設。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0307019", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0307019", "type": "orig", "text": "有於原本有 uppajjati（起），以前後之比較，乃 paññayati 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0314020", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0314020", "type": "orig", "text": "損減原本之 apacayaṁ gacchanti 直譯為「趣不積集」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0315021", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0315021", "type": "orig", "text": "雙結原本之 yuganandhā 註有「物同一剎那相結合」ckak-khaṇikayuganandhā 且衍為：「蓋此等，於一剎那有一止，他剎那有觀。如是成為異剎那者。而說明聖道同為一剎那。」"}
{"id": null, "n": "0318022", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0318022", "type": "orig", "text": "等不等（samavisama）於雜阿含作為所行非法行、所行疎澀行。Lord Chalmers: walk sometimes righteously but sometimes unrighteously."}
{"id": null, "n": "0318023", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0318023", "type": "orig", "text": "諸賢！（Bhonto）此字有主格和呼格之兩用，今為後者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0319024", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0319024", "type": "orig", "text": "隨行 Anavaya = accordance, conclusion, & c, Lord Chalmers: result 今暫依荻原博士之梵漢辭典中之譯字。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0319025", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0319025", "type": "orig", "text": "「諸長老」次句云「諸尊者」其原皆是 Āyasmanto，一為俗人乃至異學，一為佛教出家者，故如是別譯之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0320026", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0320026", "type": "orig", "text": "實（tathā hi），或「因為」亦可。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0320027", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0320027", "type": "orig", "text": "修習 paṭisevanti = They pursue, follow, practis or indulge in."}
{"id": null, "n": "0320028", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0320028", "type": "orig", "text": "如是（tatthā），或作「其時」「於此」二者皆可。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0320029", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0320029", "type": "orig", "text": "雖再看 disvā disvā，以下同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0327030", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0327030", "type": "orig", "text": "「一之」aññatthā = differently, in other way."}
